  "description": "You create a spectral sword that hovers within range. When the sword appears, you make a melee spell attack against a target within 5 feet of the sword. On a hit, the target takes Force damage equal to 4d12 plus your spellcasting ability modifier. On later turns, you can take a Bonus Action to move the sword up to 30 feet and repeat the attack against the same target or a different one.",
